<title>USA: First Savings Bank sets 10 pct stock div.</title>
<headline>First Savings Bank sets 10 pct stock div.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH AMBOY, N.J. 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Savings Bank, SLA on Tuesday declared a 10 percent stock dividend, payable on December 15, 1996, to stockholders of record on December 2, 1996.</p>
<p>Owners of the Bank's common stock will receive one new share of stock for every 10 shares owned on December 2.</p>
<p>This dividend is in addition to the regular quarterly cash dividend of $0.10 per share which will be paid November 29, 1996, to stockholders of record as of November 15, the firm said.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk +1 212 859 1610</p>
